  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Heterotrophic production rates in the Mackenzie lake (stamukhi) was measured to study origins and dynamics of microbial community in the stamukhi lake to understand basic properties of this ecosystem and predict consequences of climate change and shifts in the arctic ice regime.  Heterotrophic activity was also measured to evaluate the contribution of the stamukhi lake toward carbon cycling."
